        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Know where the data goes</p>
        <h1 itemprop="headline">An offline weight tracker with no account.</h1>
        <p itemprop="description">&ldquo;Offline&rdquo; and &ldquo;no account&rdquo; should mean something concrete: no server, no login, no analytics, and no way for the app to send your weight anywhere it should not. Here is what WeekScale actually does.</p>
