                            <tr><td>CSV export</td><td>Created only after you choose to export, then shared with an app you pick.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>System backups</td><td>May include app data through Android backup or iCloud, depending on your settings.</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
